The trace found a container PID-namespace mismatch: Lean asks for `/proc/9/exe`, but that entry is absent even though `/proc/self/exe` works. I’ll use a narrowly scoped preload shim that only retries a failed `/proc/<pid>/exe` lookup as `/proc/self/exe`; it preserves the actual executable path and leaves all successful filesystem calls untouched. Then I’ll rerun the pinned-toolchain gate and preflight.
